# The payoff of the model, demonstrated rather than argued.
#
# A protocol artifact denotes structure. Which theorem you apply to it is not
# part of it, so a second analysis is a second derivation and not a second
# artifact. When the cited capacity conjecture was refuted, a design that put
# the citation inside the identity preimage could not replace it without moving
# every artifact that cited it. Here the artifact does not move.

# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: zkc-seal %S/../Encoding/sumcheck-fs.mlir %zkc-seal-full -o %t/sealed.artifacts > /dev/null
# RUN: %python %S/../SemanticClosure/lib/artifact_handoff.py stage %t/sealed.artifacts %t/sealed.mlirbc

